{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This functionality let users start an outdoor navigation from your app, and it manage the come back to your app with the user arrive to the airport.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Make-outdoor-navigation-work","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Make outdoor navigation work:"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To manage the come back to App, Indoor SDK register several regions alerts, when the user enter of one of them, Indoor SDK evaluate the position and launch a notification."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To evaluate region and manage the return through the notification, it’s needed a two step configuration.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Step-1-Be-sure-the-location-services-are-on","text":"Step 1: Be sure the location services are on","type":"heading","level":4},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To guarantee this you must start IndoorSDK as soon as possible. Be sure you make this in the appropriate method of your appDelegate","type":"text"}]},{"code":["func application(_ application: UIApplication, didFinishLaunchingWithOptions launchOptions: [UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey: Any]?) -> Bool {","        ","                IndoorModule.shared.start()","               \/\/ Override point for customization after application launch.","               return true","               }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Step-2-Manage-notification","type":"heading","level":4,"text":"Step 2: Manage notification"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When user press the notification to continue with indoor navigation, the app must open in the map to continue with route.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"IndoorSDK provide in its class ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.geographica.I